WEBVTT

00:08.750 --> 00:11.490
You're supposed to call me Yoshino, remember?

00:11.490 --> 00:15.200
<i>Why would I have a 
nonsensical dream like that?</i>

00:17.180 --> 00:18.470
<i>Nope, not happening!</i>

00:18.970 --> 00:20.890
<i>Absolutely not!</i>

00:21.330 --> 00:23.750
<b>Gâteau au Chocolat Cake</b>

00:21.330 --> 00:23.750
The real deal!
Truffle Chocolates

00:21.330 --> 00:23.750
How to make them on page 36

00:21.330 --> 00:23.750
Hey, these are cute!

00:23.750 --> 00:26.720
I guess we could make chocolate cake, too.

00:26.720 --> 00:29.230
I prefer nama chocolates myself.

00:29.230 --> 00:31.260
What do you think, Kojuurou-kun?

00:32.970 --> 00:42.930
Feature on Homemade
Valentine's Chocolates

00:33.260 --> 00:37.450
Cakes with whipping cream in them 
taste great, but don't keep very long.

00:37.450 --> 00:40.280
They might be hard to take to class.

00:40.280 --> 00:42.930
Oh, that's right!

00:43.570 --> 00:45.440
There has to be a good idea somewhere.

00:45.440 --> 00:48.240
That's rare. Kojuurou's popular with the girls.

00:48.240 --> 00:52.490
Kojuurou-sama is considered 
a savior to troubled girls.

00:52.490 --> 00:53.610
A savior?

00:53.610 --> 00:56.070
Oh, morning, you two!

00:56.540 --> 00:59.280
What are you all talking about? Seems fun.

00:59.280 --> 01:02.560
Absolutely not! This is a very 
serious strategy meeting.

01:02.560 --> 01:04.040
Strategy meeting?

01:04.040 --> 01:07.000
The real deal!
Truffle Chocolates

01:04.040 --> 01:07.000
Perfect for buzzworthy pictures
Lollipop Chocolates

01:04.040 --> 01:07.000
<b>Gâteau au Chocolat Cake</b>

01:04.290 --> 01:07.000
Feature on Homemade
Valentine's Chocolates

01:04.330 --> 01:07.000
Super-rich Gâteau
au Chocolat

01:04.410 --> 01:07.000
<b>Easy Chocolate Muffins</b>

01:04.570 --> 01:07.000
We're getting ready for Valentine's Day!

01:08.930 --> 01:10.680
Valentine's Day?

02:42.440 --> 02:45.680
Yup! Valentine's Day!

02:45.680 --> 02:48.770
Ah... you act early.

02:45.890 --> 02:51.900
<b>#9 "Saint Valentine Is Watching"</b>

02:48.770 --> 02:55.520
Failure is not an option, so we've asked 
the Sweets Shogun to act as our consultant.

02:55.520 --> 02:58.300
Makabe-kun! They actually need me!

02:58.300 --> 03:00.030
Do I look manly?

03:00.030 --> 03:02.910
W-Well, I definitely think they trust you...

03:02.910 --> 03:05.740
<i>Though it's pretty obvious that 
they just see you as one of them...</i>

03:06.060 --> 03:09.350
You'll be getting some from me, 
too, so look forward to it.

03:09.350 --> 03:11.690
Actually, do you have any requests?

03:11.690 --> 03:13.960
Huh? N-No, I'm...

03:13.960 --> 03:18.060
<i>I'm interested because it shows who's 
popular, but I don't want any sweets...</i>

03:18.060 --> 03:21.720
Oh, I guess you'd be getting 
some from Adagaki-san.

03:21.720 --> 03:24.060
I guess I shouldn't butt in.

03:24.060 --> 03:25.430
R-Right...

03:29.060 --> 03:31.480
The ones from Shop A 
have black tea syrup inside.

03:31.480 --> 03:33.580
The ones from Shop B are almond-flavored.

03:33.580 --> 03:36.360
Shop C seemed very proud of 
how good their cacao is.

03:36.870 --> 03:39.030
Then I guess I'll start with Shop A.

03:41.240 --> 03:44.350
Hmm... I wish they had more depth.

03:44.350 --> 03:46.080
More depth desired.

03:46.560 --> 03:50.270
You said the next ones are almond-flavored, 
right? Do you want to try them?

03:50.270 --> 03:51.550
Aki-sama...

03:51.550 --> 03:54.740
Is this a rehearsal for Valentine's Day?

03:55.170 --> 03:57.210
Wh-Wh-What are you talking about?

03:57.210 --> 03:59.720
These are just snacks for me! 
I'm getting my carbs!

03:59.720 --> 04:01.150
"Getting your carbs"...

04:01.150 --> 04:04.600
That's right! I'm not falling for 
this "Valentine's Day" nonsense!

04:04.600 --> 04:07.050
Why don't you try making homemade chocolates?

04:07.050 --> 04:09.390
Are you even listening to me?

04:09.390 --> 04:11.850
Well, I'm sure it would make him happy.

04:14.280 --> 04:16.270
Why are you like this?

04:16.980 --> 04:20.230
He'll just laugh at me if I can't 
make something proper.

04:21.040 --> 04:24.700
Don't worry. I'll teach you how to make them.

04:28.610 --> 04:30.120
You've got this.

04:33.540 --> 04:36.380
Hmph! This is easy as pie!

04:36.380 --> 04:37.500
Hot!

04:43.550 --> 04:48.020
Maybe I should get Japanese-style 
matcha chocolates for Fujinomiya-san...

04:48.020 --> 04:51.350
Wait, would it be weird 
for me to give them to her?

04:54.770 --> 04:56.520
Ingredients for 3 muffins
 Butter (Margarine is also OK!) 45g
 Chocolate 60g A little more than 1 bar of chocolate
 Sugar 25g
 Cocoa Powder 10g

04:54.770 --> 04:56.520
I didn't make enough last year,
so I need to make more
Obligatory chocolates 25
 Friendship chocolates 25
 Chocolates for me 5
 (for tasting!)
 Make around 60??
 20x more!!

04:54.770 --> 04:56.520
Okay, I've got the recipe down.

04:56.520 --> 05:00.100
If we split up the cost of 
the ingredients three ways...

05:00.980 --> 05:03.210
That's over budget!

05:04.460 --> 05:05.360
Onii-chan!

05:05.360 --> 05:07.200
Try these!

05:07.520 --> 05:08.990
Huh? Chocolates?

05:08.990 --> 05:10.960
I'm gonna give them to my friends tomorrow.

05:10.960 --> 05:13.790
Tell me if you think they're good or not.

05:13.790 --> 05:14.460
Nope!

05:14.460 --> 05:16.700
Aw, come on! One won't hurt.

05:16.700 --> 05:17.460
Yes, it will.

05:17.460 --> 05:20.490
Do you know how many kilometers I'd have to run

05:20.490 --> 05:22.670
just to burn off the calories in one of those?

05:22.670 --> 05:26.680
What, so even if you get chocolates on 
Valentine's Day, you won't eat them?

05:27.330 --> 05:32.280
That girl who came over that one time 
might be making some for you.

05:32.280 --> 05:36.700
And yet you're gonna say, "I don't want 
any sweets because they'll make me fat"?

05:36.700 --> 05:37.770
You're the worst!

05:37.770 --> 05:39.400
I didn't say I'd do that!

05:39.710 --> 05:42.200
Then you'll eat them, right?

05:43.940 --> 05:45.570
They're finished!

05:45.930 --> 05:49.440
It's the day before, 
but I somehow made it in time!

05:49.440 --> 05:53.330
I'm glad we abandoned the nama 
chocolate route and went for cookies.

05:53.740 --> 05:55.080
Yes.

05:59.160 --> 06:01.540
Yes, these are perfectly scrumptious.

06:01.840 --> 06:03.210
Want some?

06:03.210 --> 06:05.260
No, I'm going to clean up.

06:05.760 --> 06:06.750
I see.

06:07.610 --> 06:10.180
Hey, you're not going to give anyone any?

06:10.640 --> 06:11.890
Huh?

06:11.890 --> 06:15.280
You know, even if you don't have 
someone particular in mind,

06:15.280 --> 06:17.100
you can give out obligatory chocolates.

06:18.310 --> 06:20.810
There are some who wouldn't enjoy getting them.

06:22.290 --> 06:24.270
Well, I guess you're right.

06:24.640 --> 06:27.990
Not everyone likes chocolate, after all.

06:36.130 --> 06:39.210
Happy Valentine's Day!

06:40.920 --> 06:41.920
Yes!

06:41.920 --> 06:44.440
It's time for Tae's annual chocolates!

06:44.440 --> 06:45.670
Is this one just for me?

06:45.670 --> 06:47.590
They're obligatory, dummy.

06:48.310 --> 06:50.300
I'll still take them!

06:52.760 --> 07:00.520
<b>Fire Hydrant</b>

06:53.960 --> 06:57.080
Calm down. Just be casual.

06:59.200 --> 07:00.520
Okay!

07:00.520 --> 07:02.630
F-Fujinomiya-san!

07:03.520 --> 07:05.480
Oh, Kojuurou-sama.

07:06.850 --> 07:09.490
Um, here you go... if you want.

07:10.160 --> 07:14.700
Oh, my. This is the first time a 
gentleman has given me chocolates.

07:14.700 --> 07:17.400
I-It <i>is</i> weird, isn't it?! I'm sorry!

07:17.400 --> 07:19.580
Not at all. I'm delighted.

07:19.950 --> 07:21.750
Thank you very much.

07:25.320 --> 07:28.040
Oh? Aki-sama.

07:28.040 --> 07:30.090
You two sure seem close.

07:30.090 --> 07:33.230
Huh?! Th-Th-Th-That's not true!

07:33.230 --> 07:36.810
Look. Kojuurou-sama gave me these.

07:36.810 --> 07:38.600
Hey, not bad.

07:39.960 --> 07:44.140
Of course, you're giving some to 
Masamune-sama, aren't you, Aki-sama?

07:44.140 --> 07:46.980
Huh?! That's none of your business!

07:46.980 --> 07:49.580
There's no need to be embarrassed.

07:49.580 --> 07:53.500
Valentine's Day is the number one 
event for couples, after all.

07:53.500 --> 07:57.070
W-Well, I'm his girlfriend, 
so of course I'm giving him chocolates.

07:57.070 --> 08:02.080
Indeed. I'm glad you seem to 
be enjoying your romance.

08:02.080 --> 08:03.210
Yeah...

08:05.130 --> 08:06.830
Let's go, Yoshino.

08:06.830 --> 08:07.660
Right.

08:12.520 --> 08:16.300
Makabe-senpai! Please take these!

08:16.890 --> 08:19.150
Oh, you're the girl from the other day.

08:19.150 --> 08:23.310
You remembered me! Oh, I'm so flattered!

08:23.310 --> 08:26.900
I'm still cherishing the 
empty bottle you gave me!

08:26.900 --> 08:27.800
Huh?!

08:29.360 --> 08:32.430
I'm ready whenever you want to 
take our relationship to the next level!

08:32.430 --> 08:34.070
I'll be waiting for you, Senpai!

08:35.000 --> 08:37.220
<i>Yeah, she's pretty bizarre...</i>

08:38.070 --> 08:39.540
<i>But still...</i>

08:39.540 --> 08:41.980
<i>I can't believe I got all these in a single day.</i>

08:44.750 --> 08:46.710
<b>Message</b>

08:44.750 --> 08:46.710
<b>Cruel Princess</b>

08:44.750 --> 08:46.710
<b>Edit</b>

08:44.750 --> 08:46.710
Come to the gym
storage.

08:44.750 --> 08:46.710
<b>Cruel Princess</b>

08:49.140 --> 08:50.680
Could this be...

08:52.550 --> 08:53.860
Adagaki-san!

08:55.330 --> 08:56.550
Sorry to keep you waiting!

08:57.770 --> 09:01.050
Well... That's quite the haul.

09:01.050 --> 09:03.100
Huh? Ah, uh... yeah...

09:04.810 --> 09:07.310
<i>Those are definitely the Cruel Princess's eyes.</i>

09:07.310 --> 09:09.640
I'm sorry! These are, uh...

09:09.640 --> 09:13.340
I guess you don't need any from me 
if you already have that many.

09:13.340 --> 09:14.070
Huh?

09:17.490 --> 09:18.990
That's not true!

09:18.990 --> 09:21.920
If you made chocolates,
I'd love to have them!

09:21.920 --> 09:23.910
<i>Truly, from the bottom of my heart.</i>

09:24.220 --> 09:25.820
You don't need to flatter me.

09:25.820 --> 09:26.870
I'm not!

09:31.600 --> 09:34.300
Then... here.

09:36.980 --> 09:38.570
Did you burn yourself?

09:38.930 --> 09:41.220
You don't need to notice that!

09:47.850 --> 09:50.610
<i>How could I betray her?</i>

09:50.610 --> 09:52.270
Do you mind if I eat these right now?

09:52.270 --> 09:54.060
Huh? R-Right now?!

09:54.060 --> 09:56.320
I'm super hungry.

09:57.110 --> 09:58.280
<i>My diet...</i>

09:59.080 --> 10:00.310
<i>My regimen...</i>

10:01.160 --> 10:02.650
<i>My physical makeover...</i>

10:03.640 --> 10:05.940
<i>My eight years' worth of wanting revenge...</i>

10:07.160 --> 10:10.130
<i>Needing to be the hot guy...</i>

10:11.970 --> 10:16.070
<i>Throw all of that away!</i>

10:18.370 --> 10:21.640
Yeah! They're super delicious,

10:22.260 --> 10:23.500
Aki-chan!

10:36.690 --> 10:38.490
<i>Crap! I overslept!</i>

10:38.490 --> 10:41.950
<i>Arriving ten minutes early 
is an absolute must for dates!</i>

10:42.510 --> 10:43.380
<i>Huh?!</i>

10:43.910 --> 10:45.260
<i>She's already here?!</i>

10:45.260 --> 10:46.830
I'm so sorry, Adagaki-san!

10:48.390 --> 10:51.960
You don't need to apologize. You're not late.

10:52.380 --> 10:55.180
Thanks. But you're pretty early.

10:55.180 --> 10:58.280
Were you that excited? Just kidding.

10:58.280 --> 10:58.920
Huh?

11:01.840 --> 11:03.180
<i>Sh-She's so cu—</i>

11:03.180 --> 11:05.880
Anyway! You came here hungry, didn't you?

11:05.880 --> 11:09.560
Of course! This whole date is about 
eating while we walk around.

11:09.560 --> 11:12.650
Will you be able to keep up 
with me until the end?

11:12.650 --> 11:15.530
I can't have you underestimating my stomach.

11:15.530 --> 11:17.980
First, we're going to be 
eating super-fluffy bread,

11:18.270 --> 11:22.200
then we're going to have lunch at 
Super Yummy Burgers, and then...

11:33.970 --> 11:37.360
Could we get three more of 
those super-fluffy breads?

11:37.360 --> 11:39.710
Should you really go that 
hard right from the start?

11:39.710 --> 11:42.520
Yes. The bread's amazing,

11:42.520 --> 11:46.490
but this omelet you can only get in 
the mornings is also incredibly good!

11:48.950 --> 11:51.610
I'd like some more, too, please! Three more!

11:54.440 --> 11:56.150
Hey, did you hear?

11:56.720 --> 11:59.360
Onii-chan's on a date 
with his girlfriend today.

11:59.360 --> 12:02.820
Yes, I know. I was so surprised!

12:02.820 --> 12:06.600
To think that narcissist brother of mine 
could actually get a girlfriend.

12:07.140 --> 12:10.290
Well, Maa-kun's changed lately.

12:10.290 --> 12:13.880
When I'd make him sweets before, 
he'd never eat them.

12:13.880 --> 12:18.000
But two days ago, he ate a whole cream puff!

12:18.840 --> 12:22.040
Actually, he's been 
eating more lately in general.

12:22.040 --> 12:25.830
He was fussing about not wanting to 
eat chocolate just the other day.

12:25.830 --> 12:26.720
Is this all...

12:27.150 --> 12:28.970
...thanks to his girlfriend?!

12:29.990 --> 12:33.630
Aw... I can't wait to meet 
Maa-kun's girlfriend!

12:33.630 --> 12:34.690
Right?

12:35.320 --> 12:39.000
Can I get a triple Super Yummy Burger meal,

12:39.000 --> 12:41.930
two sweet and hot nuggets, 
and two custard pies?

12:41.930 --> 12:43.820
Sure.

12:43.820 --> 12:45.070
What about you, Makabe?

12:45.070 --> 12:46.490
Let's see...

12:46.870 --> 12:49.830
<b>Sides 

 French Fries

 Chicken

 Sweet and Hot 
Chicken

 Custard Pie

 Apple Pie

 Soft Drinks

 Single Drinks</b>

12:46.870 --> 12:49.830
<i>Crap. I ate too much bread, 
and I'm already full.</i>

12:49.830 --> 12:51.850
You're probably full, aren't you?

12:51.850 --> 12:54.290
Don't push yourself. 
Why don't you just get a drink?

12:55.170 --> 12:57.070
No, I'll order something.

12:57.070 --> 13:00.000
My goal today is to share 
delicious things with you.

13:01.120 --> 13:04.310
I'd like a Super Yummy Burger meal, 
please. With a double patty.

13:06.790 --> 13:09.220
See? I told you.

13:09.830 --> 13:11.230
I admit defeat.

13:11.230 --> 13:13.950
But we just finished lunch...

13:13.950 --> 13:15.400
I'm so sorry.

13:18.180 --> 13:19.900
I'm really happy, though.

13:22.170 --> 13:26.700
Um, hang on just a sec. 
If I exercise a bit, I'll be hungry again.

13:29.140 --> 13:31.750
You idiot! If you do that...

13:29.140 --> 13:32.900
Two, three, four, five...

13:39.750 --> 13:42.960
Honestly... Here, have some water.

13:42.960 --> 13:45.920
Nature's Bounty
Natural Water

13:47.380 --> 13:49.260
Th-Thanks.

13:55.400 --> 13:57.930
Sorry you had to see me being so pathetic.

13:57.930 --> 14:01.260
I haven't been this full since I was a kid.

14:01.260 --> 14:04.320
Well, you did eat a lot back then.

14:04.320 --> 14:08.530
Yeah, I definitely have the potential. 
So just give me a little more time.

14:15.360 --> 14:19.460
<i>You're such an idiot.</i>

14:22.420 --> 14:26.080
Sorry... I ended up not being able 
to eat anything after that.

14:26.080 --> 14:30.200
Don't worry about it. 
I got to eat everything I wanted to,

14:30.200 --> 14:33.050
and I figured something 
like this would happen.

14:35.520 --> 14:36.730
I'm kidding.

14:37.140 --> 14:38.590
I had a lot of fun.

14:39.690 --> 14:40.460
See you later.

14:40.460 --> 14:41.580
Adagaki-san!

14:42.060 --> 14:45.280
Let's go on another date. We can 
wander around and eat again or whatever!

14:47.480 --> 14:49.490
Yes, let's.

14:58.750 --> 15:01.550
Hey, what do you want to do over spring break?

15:01.550 --> 15:03.520
You're already in spring break mode?

15:03.520 --> 15:05.290
Well, exams are over, so why not?

15:05.290 --> 15:07.660
Oh, you're all alone?

15:11.290 --> 15:12.810
So are you.

15:12.810 --> 15:16.550
Since we're both alone, do you mind 
if I have a seat next to you?

15:17.220 --> 15:18.380
Go ahead.

15:20.950 --> 15:22.560
Where's Aki-sama?

15:22.560 --> 15:24.730
Probably with Makabe.

15:24.730 --> 15:27.600
Are things going well with them?

15:27.600 --> 15:30.800
Probably. They've been 
going on a lot of dates lately.

15:30.800 --> 15:33.530
I see... And you're not lonely?

15:34.890 --> 15:36.160
What?

15:36.160 --> 15:38.800
You've always been attached 
at the hip with Aki-sama,

15:38.800 --> 15:40.540
and now you have less time with her.

15:41.030 --> 15:42.710
That's true...

15:43.290 --> 15:45.670
But I just want Aki-sama to be happy.

15:46.710 --> 15:49.120
You two have a beautiful friendship.

15:49.120 --> 15:53.640
I also want Aki-sama and
Masamune-sama to be happy.

15:57.520 --> 16:01.340
I found a hamburger shop 
yesterday that I think you'd like.

16:01.340 --> 16:02.830
Wanna go sometime?

16:02.830 --> 16:05.770
Hamburgers... Not a bad idea.

16:05.770 --> 16:09.000
Yes! It'll definitely be good.

16:09.000 --> 16:12.520
Apparently, they use the perfect 
balance of beef and pork there.

16:12.520 --> 16:14.080
Okay, Mr. Gourmand.

16:14.080 --> 16:17.340
Yup. I keep finding myself 
looking for delicious places.

16:17.340 --> 16:19.910
But I'll be fine because I'm still exercising.

16:19.910 --> 16:22.730
I don't want to go back to how I used to look.

16:25.350 --> 16:26.520
I see.

16:33.000 --> 16:33.820
Whoa!

16:33.820 --> 16:34.630
Makabe?!

16:34.630 --> 16:36.220
Ow...

16:36.220 --> 16:37.350
Are you okay?

16:41.610 --> 16:44.540
W-Workout opportunity!

16:45.600 --> 16:47.480
Well? Wasn't that amazing?

16:47.480 --> 16:49.440
S-Sure...

16:49.440 --> 16:50.910
Okay, let's go.

17:10.290 --> 17:11.630
Masamune-sama.

17:11.630 --> 17:15.470
This is yours, isn't it? 
You forgot it in the last class.

17:15.470 --> 17:17.690
Oh, how careless of me.

17:18.200 --> 17:20.100
It's snowing outside?

17:20.850 --> 17:23.510
Yikes, looks like it's gonna stick.

17:24.560 --> 17:27.130
Have you gotten a bit rounder?

17:27.130 --> 17:29.130
Hm... Maybe.

17:29.130 --> 17:32.910
I've been going along with Adagaki-san 
on her food pilgrimages lately.

17:32.910 --> 17:35.030
Oh, have you?

17:35.480 --> 17:36.390
Yeah.

17:38.360 --> 17:42.200
By the way, how have 
things been with your hives?

17:42.200 --> 17:44.910
I've been quite worried.

17:44.910 --> 17:47.520
Oh, yeah. I'm totally fine now.

17:47.520 --> 17:50.680
Really? If it happens again, 
you should go to the hospital.

17:50.680 --> 17:52.130
No, really. I'm fine!

17:52.130 --> 17:53.630
Thanks, though.

17:53.630 --> 17:57.590
And I mean, you don't die 
from hives, so I'll be fine.

18:01.080 --> 18:03.020
Where's Aki-sama today?

18:03.020 --> 18:05.470
She had something to do, apparently.

18:05.470 --> 18:08.520
Maybe I'll head home before 
the snow starts piling up.

18:09.680 --> 18:11.480
Indeed.

18:20.350 --> 18:22.300
Why is it so dark?

18:22.300 --> 18:25.830
Why would anyone put the 
projector in the cafeteria?

18:25.830 --> 18:29.790
Why did I have to be on 
class duty today of all days?

18:33.780 --> 18:35.210
I'm here.

18:35.210 --> 18:39.680
I'm terribly sorry to ask you to 
meet me in this cold weather.

18:39.680 --> 18:42.590
I'm honestly more worried about you.

18:42.590 --> 18:45.710
I couldn't sleep knowing you caught a cold 
because you refuse to wear underwear.

18:45.710 --> 18:47.640
You're so kind, Aki-sama.

18:48.110 --> 18:49.600
What do you want?

18:49.600 --> 18:52.560
I ask this from the bottom of my heart.

18:53.200 --> 18:56.280
I know I have no right to ask this,

18:57.680 --> 18:59.290
but still...

19:01.480 --> 19:02.600
Still...

19:03.600 --> 19:06.490
I must ask that you break up 
with Masamune-sama.

19:14.280 --> 19:15.920
Lift your head.

19:15.920 --> 19:17.800
There's no way I'd agree to that.

19:17.800 --> 19:21.510
Masamune-sama doesn't love you!

19:21.510 --> 19:25.470
His heart lies elsewhere, 
but he's tied down by his past feelings,

19:25.470 --> 19:27.600
and he's in so much pain right now.

19:27.600 --> 19:28.930
That's just...

19:29.340 --> 19:30.890
I already know that, okay?!

19:33.160 --> 19:34.360
I know that.

19:34.830 --> 19:36.900
I saw his planner a while back.

19:37.900 --> 19:41.320
What is this? A revenge planner?

19:41.320 --> 19:47.880
In it were various ways to get me to fall 
for him, because he hated me so much.

19:49.110 --> 19:51.210
I see.

19:51.210 --> 19:54.250
But if you knew, then why didn't you...

19:55.080 --> 19:56.460
Because...

19:57.370 --> 19:59.900
I love him, of course!

20:04.180 --> 20:07.530
At first, I absolutely couldn't believe it.

20:07.530 --> 20:13.070
I figured he casually showed interest in me 
because he was so confident about his looks.

20:13.070 --> 20:15.920
He works so hard at being an idiot.

20:15.920 --> 20:17.340
That's just...

20:17.340 --> 20:21.400
You could say he just works stupidly hard,

20:21.400 --> 20:24.380
but when he thinks I don't like him, he panics.

20:24.380 --> 20:26.970
He gets mad if I'm a bit cold.

20:27.340 --> 20:30.120
I couldn't figure out why 
he wouldn't just give up.

20:31.000 --> 20:32.300
I was so curious...

20:33.060 --> 20:36.580
Actually, when I found out he was 
the Masamune from the past...

20:37.300 --> 20:39.320
I was so happy.

20:40.760 --> 20:41.980
Aki-sama...

20:42.750 --> 20:46.490
There were a lot of things I noticed 
once we started going out, too...

20:46.490 --> 20:52.330
But it all makes sense 
if he actually doesn't like

20:49.430 --> 20:52.930
I'm going to get revenge
on that woman!!

20:53.760 --> 20:57.040
the past me or the present me.

20:57.440 --> 21:01.150
I can't understand why you feel this way!

21:01.150 --> 21:04.610
How can you say that you 
love Masamune-sama, then?

21:05.990 --> 21:07.240
Did you know?

21:08.000 --> 21:11.580
He used to be a bit weird and different, too.

21:12.000 --> 21:16.790
Even if he dislikes me or denies me, 
I won't let Masamune go now.

21:17.480 --> 21:18.750
Because...

21:19.420 --> 21:20.710
that's just who I am.

21:22.080 --> 21:26.430
So... I'm in the same boat as you. 
Our feelings only go one way.

21:30.970 --> 21:34.200
I think my feelings might be 
more deeply rooted, though.

21:53.380 --> 21:54.940
Kojuurou-sama...

21:54.940 --> 21:57.460
Oh, s-sorry!
